@@ -0,0 +1,129 @@
+# Aegis Platform v1 (Unified SaaS API)
+
+This repo contains multiple demos; the unified SaaS control-plane API entrypoint is:
+
+```bash
+uvicorn api.main_platform:app --reload
+```
+
+## 1) DB bootstrap (dev/first-run)
+
+```bash
+python -m api.bootstrap_db
+```
+
+## 2) Required environment variables
+
+### Auth (OIDC JWT via JWKS)
+- `OIDC_JWKS_URI` (required)
+- `OIDC_AUDIENCE` (optional but recommended)
+- `OIDC_ISSUER` (optional but recommended)
+- `AEGIS_TENANT_CLAIM` (default `tenant`)
+- `AEGIS_ROLES_CLAIM` (default `roles`)
+
+### Object store (AWS S3 OR MinIO)
+- `AEGIS_ARTIFACTS_BUCKET` (required)
+- `AEGIS_S3_REGION` (default `us-east-1`)
+- `AEGIS_S3_ENDPOINT_URL` (optional)
+
+For **AWS S3**: do NOT set `AEGIS_S3_ENDPOINT_URL`.
+For **MinIO in-cluster**: set `AEGIS_S3_ENDPOINT_URL=http://minio.<namespace>.svc:9000`
+
+### Signing (dev/test default)
+- `AEGIS_SIGN_MODE=hmac|noop`
+- `AEGIS_SIGN_HMAC_SECRET=...`
+
+## 3) Kubernetes
+- Local: `AEGIS_K8S_CONFIG=kubeconfig`
+- In-cluster: `AEGIS_K8S_CONFIG=incluster`
+
+## 4) Inference gateway proxy (optional)
+By default, `/v1/infer` does not forward in-cluster.
+Enable forwarding:
+  - `AEGIS_INFER_PROXY_ENABLED=true`
+  - `AEGIS_INFER_PROXY_TIMEOUT_S=10`
+
+## 5) Tenancy model
+- Namespace per tenant: `aegis-<tenant_id>`
+- All requests (except `/healthz` and `/metrics`) require JWT with a tenant claim.
